{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>鄺港傑自辯 前夫鄺港智 青紅蘿蔔湯 蔡天鳳碎屍案｜28歲名媛蔡天鳳（Abby Choi）案在高等法院續審，被告鄺港傑自辯。</p>\n<h2>父親鄺球著兩兄弟先行離開</h2>\n<p>鄺港傑的大律師 Trevor Beel繼續問，鄺港傑稱三人抵達龍尾村後，他與父親把膠箱搬入單位，鄺球其後著兩兄弟盡快離開，並表示餘下事情由他處理。鄺港智手持白色膠袋離去前，曾低聲向兄長說：「我走啦。」</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e6%8e%a5%e6%94%be%e5%ad%b8-%e4%b8%83%e4%ba%ba%e8%bb%8a-2454496/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑指證胞弟鄺港智為兇手 詳述蔡分半鐘遇害經過 鄺球得知後沉默數秒回應</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>鄺港傑表示，自己當時腦海一片混亂，沒有追問弟弟去向，只感到對方狀態異常，甚至令他覺得眼前胞弟十分陌生，「我覺得喺嗰段時間佢有啲陌生，因為我未見過佢咁嘅狀態」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%85%87%e6%89%8b-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af-2454348/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑稱胞弟鄺港智殺害蔡天鳳 原因盤算部署惹熱議 網民揭開鄺家三父子自救方法</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<h2>被告鄺港傑親述恐慌棄置手機 </h2>\n<p>鄺港傑憶述，離開村屋後曾獨自在車內逗留，反覆思索事件何以發展至此，「應該係諗緊點解會搞成咁，點解會發生事情。」</p>\n<p>他表示自己其後漫無目的駕車前往大埔超級城，希望到洗手間冷靜。他檢查車廂時發現蔡天鳳的手機，因害怕手機留在車內，遂把裝置關掉並棄進洗手間垃圾桶。他形容當刻「自己都唔知自己做緊乜」，又稱腦中仍未能消化胞弟涉及襲擊及殺害蔡天鳳的情況。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e7%9c%9f%e9%9d%a2%e7%9b%ae-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%ba%ab%e4%bb%bd%e7%89%b9%e6%ae%8a-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%b0%8f%e7%94%b7%e4%ba%ba-2454105/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑自認家中身份特殊 揭蔡天鳳私下真面目 曾斥弟鄺港傑「似返個男人」</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>Beel 追問鄺港傑當時為何感到驚慌。他解釋「因為 Abby 啱啱喺嗰個鐘頭內死咗，而我架車入面有佢部電話，呢個係我當刻嘅認知。我只係想扔咗佢，唔想呢啲嘢留喺我架車。」鄺港傑遂將電話關機，然後棄掉。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%93%a1-%e5%81%a5%e5%ba%b7%e7%90%86%e7%94%b1-%e6%b3%95%e5%ae%98-%e9%ab%98%e7%ad%89%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2-%e8%ac%80%e6%ae%ba%e6%a1%88-2453977/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案續審前法官解除1陪審員職務「不適合繼續擔任」理由曝光</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e5%90%88%e7%85%a7-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%a7%e4%bc%af-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e8%a6%aa%e5%af%86%e6%9c%8b%e5%8f%8b-2450674/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳鄺港傑多張合照庭上曝光 譚方駿首回應二人真實關係 警公開鄺最後接觸蔡衣服</a></p>\n<h2>鄺港傑首披露蔡天鳳殘肢感受</h2>\n<p>警方在警署告知已於龍尾村單位發現蔡天鳳殘肢，當時被捕的他隨即失控痛哭，「嗰刻先湧出嚟，我記得嗰時就開始喊出嚟啦。」面對問話亦無法作答，只能「淨係識得喊」。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%85%a7%e5%9c%b0%e5%a5%b3%e5%8f%8b-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e6%83%85%e5%a9%a6-2454035/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑爆胞弟有女友 蔡知情後曾向子女哭訴 鄺球被逐出豪宅「住情婦屋企」導火線</a></p>\n<p>大律師Trevor Beel追問，當時是蔡天鳳遇害後鄺是否首次哭泣，鄺回答「喊成咁樣係」，又指「警察問我嗰啲嘢，我都冇答佢」。他解釋，哭泣並非因自己被捕，而是此前一直「好似呃緊自己無發生過。」；直到警方確認發現蔡天鳳的遺體，「我嘅理智先同我講，係有發生過呢件事。」</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e4%bc%91%e5%ba%ad-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e7%89%a9%e6%a5%ad-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6-2445324/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜蔡天鳳告知真相 譚方駿難過掩面 主控官提出休庭 鄺球於犯人欄疑哭泣</a></p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/3_11355532267a2e5c92bc2e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳碎屍案 青紅蘿蔔湯 （圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.sundaykiss.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/3_11355532267a2e5c92bc2e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@xxabbyc）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p> </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%a6%aa%e5%85%84%e5%a6%b9-%e8%b5%b4%e7%be%8e%e5%8d%87%e5%ad%b8-%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e9%84%ba-2453477/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺港傑身世學歷家庭背景 8字剖白與蔡天鳳關係 母親李瑞香職業首曝光</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e6%be%b3%e9%96%80%e8%b3%ad%e9%8c%a2-500%e8%90%ac%e8%b3%ad%e5%82%b5-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e7%84%a1%e8%a8%bb%e5%86%8a-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2443847/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜丈夫譚方駿與蔡天鳳無註冊原因 譚家被上門收數 譚父曾向鄺球求助</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%8b%9c%e8%a7%80%e9%9f%b3-%e7%b6%93%e6%96%87%e8%a1%a3%e7%b4%99-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e5%87%ba%e4%b8%96-%e5%ac%b0%e5%85%92%e6%b5%b4%e7%9b%86-2451997/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜龍尾村單位藏經文衣紙 主控問有否嬰兒出世獲5字回答 鄺球父子曾帶嬰兒浴盆入屋</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83%e5%90%8d%e4%b8%8b-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-2442309/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜豪宅登記鄺球名下始末 豪宅出資人並非蔡天鳳 蔡母揭女兒收入來源：未婚前已有「億幾兩億」</a><br/>\n<a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ba%ab%e4%b8%96-%e5%ae%b6%e5%ba%ad%e8%83%8c%e6%99%af-%e5%ad%b8%e6%ad%b7-%e5%8a%a0%e5%a4%9a%e5%88%a9%e5%b1%b1%e8%b1%aa%e5%ae%85-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2440816/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜控方揭蔡天鳳身世學歷背景 買豪宅另有苦衷 母女訊息惹關注 拆解鄺家奪命計劃</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%ad%bb%e5%9b%a0-%e5%a5%b3%e6%b3%95%e9%86%ab%e9%83%ad%e5%98%89%e7%90%aa-%e9%a0%ad%e9%83%a8-%e5%a4%a7%e5%b0%8f%e6%b9%af%e7%85%b2-%e7%a2%8e%e5%b1%8d-%e9%9d%92%e7%b4%85-2452341/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜女法醫親解蔡天鳳真正死因 生前頭部7次重擊 網民痛斥鄺家</a><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%bc%b5%e7%87%95%e8%8a%b1-%e5%a4%b1%e8%b9%a4-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%83%ad%e8%8e%8e%e6%a8%82-%e5%85%ac%e7%9c%be%e5%b8%ad%e7%ac%91-2442712/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e5%a7%91%e6%9d%8e%e7%91%9e%e9%a6%99-%e5%88%a4%e6%b1%ba-%e5%85%92%e5%ad%90%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab-cctv-2451516/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜案發後鄺港智與母關鍵對話 李瑞香判決！法官：慈母多敗兒</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%ae%b6%e7%bf%81%e9%84%ba%e7%90%83-%e8%aa%8d%e7%bd%aa-%e5%9f%8b%e8%91%ac%e5%b1%8d%e9%ab%94-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-2450408/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜鄺球開庭前突改口認阻止合法埋葬屍體罪 原因及背後部署盤算惹熱議</a></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e5%89%8d%e5%a4%ab%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e5%90%8d%e9%8c%b6-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e4%ba%a4%e6%98%93-%e9%99%b3%e4%ba%ae%e6%81%92-damon-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e5%82%91-2447584/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜前妻遇害後 名錶職員揭鄺港智異常舉止 提出1大古怪要求：我照做</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e6%ad%a4%e6%83%85%e4%b8%8d%e5%86%8d-%e9%90%98%e9%8c%b6%e7%94%9f%e6%84%8f-%e5%a5%b3%e5%85%92%e7%99%bc%e7%87%92-2446053/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿稱與鄺港智「此情不再」剖白關係變化內情 1事令關係逆轉：我打咗個突</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e5%85%a8%e5%ae%b6%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1-%e7%a7%bb%e6%b0%91%e8%8b%b1%e5%9c%8b-%e9%84%ba%e8%ad%9a%e5%ad%90%e5%a5%b3-%e9%84%ba-2445666/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿首披露帶妻及4子女全家移英計劃 蔡天鳳拒鄺譚子女同住原因</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.sundaykiss.com/%e7%86%b1%e8%a9%b1/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e8%ad%9a%e6%96%b9%e9%a7%bf-%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab-%e6%be%b3%e6%b4%b2%e7%95%99%e5%ad%b8-%e9%84%ba%e6%b8%af%e6%99%ba-%e7%b9%bc%e5%ad%90%e7%b9%bc%e5%a5%b3-2444979/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">蔡天鳳案｜譚方駿出庭作供剖白與蔡天鳳相識經過 揭蔡11字回應鄺港智突失蹤7年</a>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T11:23:57.202062+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1535,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T10:04:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:37:28.484588+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:17:26.638826+00:00","content_hash":"3830fafc05a4235314d3856c46e7e25f29fd388eec9440a353b0fc9c8368c78f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}